{"day":10,"title_ko":"저녁 초대","title_en":"Dinner at my place","setting_ko":"제이크가 Jiwoo 씨 집에 저녁 먹으러 와요","grammar":"review_1","cast":[{"name":"Jake","me":false},{"name":"Jiwoo","me":true}],"lines":[{"n":1,"who":"Jake","me":false,"en":"Hi, Jiwoo! What are you cooking? It smells great.","sp":"Hi, Jiwoo! Whatcha cookin'? It smells great.","hk":"하이, {NAME}! 와챠 쿠킨? 잇 스멜즈 그레잇.","ko":"Jiwoo 씨, 안녕하세요! 뭐 요리해요? 냄새 정말 좋아요.","red":[{"w":"What are you","h":"Whatcha","k":"와챠","r":"whatcha"},{"w":"cooking","h":"cookin'","k":"쿠킨","r":"ing_in"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d010/l01_","gap":600},{"n":2,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"It's bulgogi. You're hungry, right?","sp":"It's bulgogi. You're hungry, righ'?","hk":"잇츠 불고기. 유어 헝그리, 라잇?","ko":"불고기예요. 배고프죠?","red":[{"w":"right","h":"righ'","k":"라잇 (t 멈춤)","r":"t_stop"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d010/l02_","gap":600},{"n":3,"who":"Jake","me":false,"en":"Yes! I didn't have lunch today.","sp":"Yes! I didn' have lunch today.","hk":"예스! 아이 디든 해브 런치 투데이.","ko":"네! 오늘 점심을 못 먹었어요.","red":[{"w":"didn't","h":"didn'","k":"디든","r":"t_drop"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d010/l03_","gap":600},{"n":4,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"Really? What did you do all day?","sp":"Really? Whadja do all day?","hk":"륄리? 와쥬 두 올 데이?","ko":"정말요? 하루 종일 뭐 했어요?","red":[{"w":"What did you","h":"Whadja","k":"와쥬","r":"what_did_you"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d010/l04_","gap":600},{"n":5,"who":"Jake","me":false,"en":"I was at the market with Ben. We walked a lot.","sp":"I wuz at the market with Ben. We walked a lot.","hk":"아이 워잿 더 마킷 위드 벤. 위 웍터 랏.","ko":"벤이랑 시장에 있었어요. 많이 걸었어요.","red":[{"w":"was at","h":"wuz-at","k":"워잿","r":"linking"},{"w":"walked a","h":"walk-ta","k":"웍터","r":"linking"}],"a":"../audio/drama/d010/l05_","gap":600},{"n":6,"who":"Jiwoo","me":true,"en":"Do you usually walk a lot in Texas?","sp":"D'you usually walk a lot in Texas?","hk":"쥬 유주얼리 워커 라린 텍서스?","ko":"텍사스에서도 보통 많이 걸어요?","red":[{"w":"Do you","h":"D'you","k":"쥬","r":"do_you"},{"w":"lot in","h":"lod-in","k":"라린","r":"flap_t"}],"a":"